From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Elia Devito <eliadevito@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Dec 2024 20:41:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] win32u: HACK: Hide a window for Post Mortem.

Post Mortem needs the same hack as Syberia to avoid a black screen until
it is possible to properly implement exclusive fullscreen ddraw mode.

CW-Bug-Id: #23858
CW-Bug-Id: #25542
(cherry picked from commit 07346d6b546f4a1dd096d887f1f5fdf68d5c7c69)
---
 dlls/win32u/window.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dlls/win32u/window.c b/dlls/win32u/window.c
index 7d26917cc02..1e3800aa936 100644
--- a/dlls/win32u/window.c
+++ b/dlls/win32u/window.c
@@ -809,7 +809,7 @@ HWND WINAPI NtUserSetParent( HWND hwnd, HWND parent )
         WCHAR name[32];
         UNICODE_STRING us = { 0, sizeof(name), name };
 
-        if (NtUserGetClassName( hwnd, FALSE, &us ) && !wcscmp( us.Buffer, u"SyberiaRenderWindowClass" ))
+        if (NtUserGetClassName( hwnd, FALSE, &us ) && ( !wcscmp( us.Buffer, u"SyberiaRenderWindowClass" ) || !wcscmp( us.Buffer, u"Post MortemRenderWindowClass" ) ))
         {
             ERR( "HACK: Hiding window.\n" );
             was_visible = FALSE;
